WEBVTT

29:01.141 --> 29:02.475
We both did.

29:02.600 --> 29:06.938
ROBERT: He never had to teach you much,
but me? You remember me at 16?

29:07.063 --> 29:08.898
- (CHUCKLES)
- All I wanted to do

29:09.024 --> 29:11.651
was crack skulls and fuck girls.

29:11.776 --> 29:14.904
- He showed me what was what.
- Aye.

29:15.030 --> 29:17.657
Don't look at me like that.
It's not his fault I didn't listen.

29:17.782 --> 29:19.617
(BOTH LAUGH)

29:20.368 --> 29:22.078
(SIGHS)

29:22.203 --> 29:24.247
I need you, Ned,

29:24.372 --> 29:28.043
down at King's Landing, not up here
where you're no damn use to anybody.

29:29.919 --> 29:31.713
Lord Eddard Stark...
